# variants/kits/system/worker — the worker's thin host: containers, VMs, its own disks
#
# LEAF set: a flat list of atoms. See kits/core/base for the layering contract.
#
# The worker is core + podman + KVM: a job runs natively through `systemd-run` with
# the venv the host ships, and only the builds run in `systemd-nspawn`; podman is
# the container engine kept for container builds. KVM needs no package (the dist
# kernel carries kvm_amd/kvm_intel). smartmontools reads the machine's own disks.

app-containers/podman
sys-apps/smartmontools
